						<div class="text-[11px] font-mono font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200 uppercase tracking-wide">💡 Key Takeaway</div>
						<div class="text-xs text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300 font-sans mt-0.5">Never accept lower returns on corporate insurance policies than risk-free PPF.</div>
